  "details": "From what I've been able to gather from testing franada's GoGo Locomotion prefabs, horizon adjust apparently \"breaks\" how it works when using something like OVR Advanced Settings' playspace mover.\n\n1) Use horizon adjust when laying down to set your height and horizonal view\n\n2) Have GoGo Locomotion 1.7.8 or newer on the avatar.\n\n3) Use OVR Advance Settings playspace mover functions and move your play space up.\n\n4) Move/Locomote around, the result should snap you directly into the ground. the same thing happens if you playspace vertically while locomoting with horizon adjust.",
